<section id="details" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-ivory py-20 md:py-28" data-reveal>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center md:px-8">
		<h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-plum md:text-4xl">
			<span data-strand="en">The celebration</span>
			<span data-strand="es">La celebración</span>
		</h2>
		<div class="mx-auto mt-4 h-px w-24 bg-mauve/60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-brown-soft md:text-xl">
			<span data-strand="en"
				>We are delighted to invite you to an evening of dinner, dancing, and September twilight on
				the estate grounds. Ceremony on the lawn, followed by cocktails in the garden and reception in
				the barn.</span
			><span data-strand="es"
				>Nos encantaría compartir contigo una velada de cena, baile y el crepúsculo de septiembre en los
				jardines de la finca. Ceremonia en el césped, después cóctel en el jardín y recepción en el granero.</span
			>
		</p>
		<dl class="mt-12 grid gap-8 text-left sm:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-mauve/15 bg-cream/80 p-6 shadow-sm">
				<dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-olive">
					<span data-strand="en">When</span>
					<span data-strand="es">Cuándo</span>
				</dt>
				<dd class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl text-plum">
					<span data-strand="en">Saturday, September 12, 2026</span>
					<span data-strand="es">sábado 12 de septiembre de 2026</span>
				</dd>
				<dd class="mt-1 text-brown-soft">
					<span data-strand="en">Doors open at 3:30 PM</span>
					<span data-strand="es">Las puertas abren a las 3:30 p. m.</span>
				</dd>
				<dd class="mt-1 text-brown-soft">
					<span data-strand="en">Ceremony begins at 4:30 PM</span>
					<span data-strand="es">La ceremonia comienza a las 4:30 p. m.</span>
				</dd>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-mauve/15 bg-cream/80 p-6 shadow-sm">
				<dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-olive">
					<span data-strand="en">Where</span>
					<span data-strand="es">Dónde</span>
				</dt>
				<dd class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl text-plum">Tesoro Adobe Historic Park</dd>
				<dd class="mt-1 text-brown-soft">29350 Avenida Rancho Tesoro, Valencia, CA 91354</dd>
			</div>
		</dl>
		<p class="mt-10 text-sm text-brown-muted">
			<span data-strand="en"
				>Dress code: garden formal — think flowing fabrics, soft layers, and comfortable shoes for the
				lawn.</span
			><span data-strand="es"
				>Código de vestimenta: formal de jardín — telas fluidas, capas suaves y zapatos cómodos para el
				césped.</span
			>
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
